1. Grant of License

   The copyright holder grants you a free, non-exclusive, non-transferable and
   revocable license to install and run the binary distribution of this software
   on devices you own or control, strictly for PERSONAL, NON-COMMERCIAL purposes.

   "Personal, non-commercial use" means using the software for your own study,
   research, or as a reference for your own investment decisions, without
   deriving commercial benefit, directly or indirectly.

2. You May

   a. Install, run and uninstall the software on your personal devices.
   b. Use the reports and analyses it generates as a reference for your own
      research and decisions.
   c. Make copies of the installer for personal backup purposes.

3. You May Not

   a. Use the software for any commercial purpose, including but not limited to:
      internal business use by any company or institution; providing services
      (paid or free) to third parties; offering investment advisory services
      based on its output; reselling, renting, lending or bundling the software
      or its output.
   b. Redistribute, re-upload, repackage the software, or embed it in another
      product for distribution.
   c. Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the software, or otherwise
      attempt to derive its source code, except to the extent such restriction
      is expressly prohibited by applicable mandatory law.
   d. Remove, obscure or alter any branding, copyright notice or disclaimer.
   e. Use the software for any purpose that violates applicable law.

4. Source Code

   This license covers the binary distribution only. The source code is not
   published, and no rights to it are granted under this license.

5. Consequences of Breach

   Upon any breach of Section 3:

   a. This license TERMINATES AUTOMATICALLY without notice. You must immediately
