   b. The copyright holder reserves the right to seek injunctive relief and
      damages, and to pursue civil liability under applicable copyright and
      unfair-competition law. In serious cases, the copyright holder reserves
      the right to refer the matter to judicial authorities for criminal
      liability.
   c. The copyright holder is entitled to claim all proceeds derived from any
      commercial use.

6. Commercial Licensing

   To use this software in any commercial context, you must obtain a separate
   written commercial license from the copyright holder in advance.

7. Disclaimer and Limitation of Liability

   a. THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
      IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,
      FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.
   b. THIS SOFTWARE DOES NOT CONSTITUTE INVESTMENT ADVICE. It is a research aid.
      It does not connect to any broker and cannot place orders. Its output may
      contain errors, omissions or outdated information.
   c. Market and financial data are obtained from free third-party public
      endpoints and may be delayed, revised, interrupted or unavailable. No
