   d. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER SHALL NOT BE
      LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL
      DAMAGES ARISING FROM THE USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SOFTWARE,
      INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO INVESTMENT LOSSES.
   e. Every investment decision you make using this software, and all of its
      consequences, are yours alone. Markets carry risk.

8. Governing Law

   This agreement is governed by the laws of the mainland of the People's
   Republic of China. Disputes shall first be resolved through good-faith
